    Even (Fintype.card κ) → ∃ ω : (Matrix κ ι ℚ → ℂ) → (Matrix κ ι ℚ → ℂ), ∀ φ, IsSB φ →
      IsSB (ω φ) ∧ TransS (Matrix.J ι ℚ) φ (ω φ) ∧
